  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> 짇<ruby>배<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PJJhHihvDpo?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>過<rt>궤</rt></ruby>’ᄅᆤ <ruby>下昏暗<rt>옝ˉ암</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>和<rt>함-</rt></ruby><ruby>別人<rt>받랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>結婚<rt>곋ˆ훈ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kue’liau yēng-am bêh-ham-pat-láng kiêt-hûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>聽講<rt>턀ˉ겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>別人<rt>받랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>囝孫<rt>걀ˆ순ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    thiā̰-kông-lì î-kiēng-u-pat-láng’e kiâ̰-sûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>結果<rt>곋ˆ고ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>最後<rt>줴ˋᄋᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一步<rt>짇버ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiêt-kò ma-si-kia̰-kàu-juè-au-jit-pōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>翁<rt>앙ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>猶未<rt>얗ˆ쀄-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>𡚸<rt>뻐ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tio-si-lì u-âng goà yâh-bue-u-bòr\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想起<rt>슐키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>歹<rt>팰ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>賰<rt>춘ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-khî-hît-sí lì si-phâ̰i-kâh-u-chûn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>拄<rt>두ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>好命<rt>호ˆ먀ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>天份<rt>톈ˉ훈ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tû-tioh-goà si-lî-hô-miā’e thiēn-hūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>結果<rt>곋ˆ고ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀-</rt></ruby><ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>最後<rt>줴ˋᄋᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一步<rt>짇버ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiêt-kò ma-si-kia̰-kàu-juè-au-jit-pōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>斡頭走<rt>왇ᄐᅷᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>매<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>再<rt>재ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>耽誤<rt>담ˉ꺼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tio-si-oat-thau-jàu mài-kôh-jài-tām-gōr\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>知<rt>재ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-jâi lì si-ti-tô-wī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>聽<rt>턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>溫柔<rt>운ˉ뜌ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>聲音<rt>샬ˉ임ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà siṵ-bêh-thiā̰-lî-ūn-riú’e siā̰-îm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>以後<rt>이ˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>當做<rt>덩ˉ죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>捌<rt>빧</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    î-āu goà e-tōng-joè-m-bat’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>過去<rt>궤ˋ킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-làn’e kuè-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>工<rt>강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>牽<rt>칸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>起<rt>키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>手<rt>츄ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-si-hît-kâng si-goà lai-khān-khî-lì’e chiù\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>馬<rt>마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>完成<rt>완솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>要求<rt>ᄋᆤˉ규ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tio-m-si-jît-mà si-ī lai-oan-sieng-lì’e yāu-kiú\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>工<rt>강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-<